Rob Ingram (rji@nyquist.cs.nott.ac.uk) wrote:
: Is there a neutrally aligned artefact to compare with Stormy and
: Excalibur?

Vorpal Blade
Fire Brand 
Frost Brand
Magicbane

Are all very good weapons.  When I play a neutral character, I usually
end up getting all of those from sacraficing enough stuff.  I also get 
Mjollnir from a wish to round off my weapons.

Vorpal Blade is pretty good.  It doesn't have any special plusses, but
occasionally scores an instant kill on anything with a head.

Magicbane (an athame) is surprisingly a good weapon.  Its probably due to
its ability to drain magic (giving it to you as magic points) and stun
the opponent.  So even if it doesn't do lots of damage like Fire/Frost
Brand, your opponent doesn't get as much chance to hit you.

